Option: phone-number-shown
Name: Show the main phone number in the footer
Does: Adds 704-628-6232 (a tel: link) to the footer contact block of every page and "telephone" to the home page structured data. The Questions? fact and the contact cards are not changed. The consistency test already allows one main number besides the day-of number, so the consistency test does not change. The unit test tools/test_check_facts.py (part of the pipeline test), which puts the number into the footer itself, leaves it alone when the footer has it already.
Answers: d04 A (main phone number)
Conflicts: none
Requires: none
Host: any
Order: 60
After: python3 tools/pages.py, then python3 tools/i18n.py extract, then python3 tools/i18n.py jsstrings, then python3 tools/i18n.py build, then python3 tools/i18n.py missing es hi zh vi (0 missing each)
Strings: 1 changed footer text (new id t286f8cf3), translated (the same text in every language) inside this patch

